ected commission) are why an edited card plan cannot rewrite history; never recompute a historical sale from card_plans.", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_verified_money_invariant", "label": "Only VERIFIED Money Counts", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "recorded is not money yet; rejected and voided never were. Every total, balance and activation decision comes from the payment rows on the server.", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_identifier_rotation", "label": "Card Credentials Rotated, Never Recovered", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Identifiers are SHA-256 hashes, so a code cannot be displayed on demand without weakening at-rest security; reissue mints fresh values and returns the plaintext exactly once.", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_redemption_points_transaction", "label": "Redemption Points Transaction Rules", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Scanning spends nothing; the client sends no figures; the identifier authorizes nothing \u2014 all three rules are load-bearing.", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_government_id_write_only", "label": "Government ID Numbers Are Write-Only", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Stored on customers, never returned; browser roles have no SELECT privilege on the columns at all, and the values must never appear in an audit_events payload.", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_migration_discipline", "label": "Idempotent afhomes_ Migration Di